Erdos302.uniform_finite_removal_rate (N V : ℕ) (hN : 4 ≤ N) (hV : 4 ≤ V) :
  0 ≤ (↑(Erdos302.relaxedExtremal V N) - ↑(Erdos302.extremal N)) / ↑N ∧
    (↑(Erdos302.relaxedExtremal V N) - ↑(Erdos302.extremal N)) / ↑N ≤
      (2 * 10 ^ 23 + 561000) * Real.log (min ↑V ↑N) ^ (-(1 / 140))
'Erdos302.uniform_finite_removal_rate' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
Erdos302.cambieSet_mem_bounds {N n : ℕ} (hn : n ∈ Erdos302.cambieSet N) :
