Erdos302.rational_enclosures (ε : ℚ) (hε : 0 < ε) :
  ∃ V S,
    4 ≤ V ∧
      ↑(Erdos302.rationalPartialValue (Erdos302.primeSet V) S - ε / 2) ≤ Erdos302.claimedConstant ∧
        Erdos302.claimedConstant ≤
            ↑(Erdos302.rationalPartialValue (Erdos302.primeSet V) S + Erdos302.rationalTail (Erdos302.primeSet V) S) ∧
          Erdos302.rationalPartialValue (Erdos302.primeSet V) S + Erdos302.rationalTail (Erdos302.primeSet V) S -
              (Erdos302.rationalPartialValue (Erdos302.primeSet V) S - ε / 2) <
            ε
'Erdos302.rational_enclosures' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
