OriginalStatementCheck.ordered_positive_classification (a b c : ℕ) (ha : 0 < a) (hb : 0 < b) (hbc : b < c) :
  1 / ↑a = 1 / ↑b + 1 / ↑c ↔
    ∃ g u v, 0 < g ∧ 0 < u ∧ u < v ∧ u.Coprime v ∧ a = g * u * v ∧ b = g * u * (u + v) ∧ c = g * v * (u + v)
'OriginalStatementCheck.ordered_positive_classification' depends on axioms: [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]
